    fix(tests): race-safe teardown in memories-blank-content-dbgap058 (INT-CI-023)
    
    afterAll now awaits server close and drains async commits before rmSync,
    with a bounded-retry rm as the final guard. The unawaited teardown raced
    the last POST's auto-commit chain / audit ledger append inside SCRATCH_ROOT
    and threw ENOTEMPTY with all tests green (CI runs 37571206935 + 37571830301,
    main red ~50% today). Mirrors the already-fixed empty-content dbgap056
    teardown (close + drainAsyncCommits + rm).
    
    Verified: tsc --noEmit clean; suite solo green 5x; src/http/routes 48/337
    green; prettier clean.
    
